  "card": "Disconnect callbacks automatically when a signal is destroyed in btcsignals, and update unit tests accordingly. Previously, if a connection handle outlived the signal, connected callbacks remained alive with captured state and the handle falsely reported connected. This follows up on merged PR #36011 to handle the implicit destruction case identified during its review.",
